<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:02.433" end="00:00:03.533" style="s2">my husband</p>
<p begin="00:00:04.100" end="00:00:08.166" style="s2">too busy protecting another woman to notice me bl**ding at his feet</p>
<p begin="00:00:08.466" end="00:00:10.400" style="s2">the servant&#39;s entrance is around back</p>
<p begin="00:00:10.400" end="00:00:11.366" style="s2">let&#39;s go human</p>
<p begin="00:00:11.366" end="00:00:14.200" style="s2">get your hands off me release her now</p>
<p begin="00:00:15.666" end="00:00:17.166" style="s2">what the hell are you doing here</p>
<p begin="00:00:17.566" end="00:00:20.400" style="s2">you know the protocol no unauthorized access</p>
<p begin="00:00:20.400" end="00:00:24.000" style="s2">afraid I&#39;ll interrupt your important work or your not so secret affair</p>
<p begin="00:00:24.000" end="00:00:25.133" style="s2">which one is it</p>
<p begin="00:00:26.400" end="00:00:29.366" style="s2">you must be Amber Julian&#39;s fated mate</p>
<p begin="00:00:29.366" end="00:00:32.066" style="s2">thank you for taking care of him for the past 3 years</p>
<p begin="00:00:36.433" end="00:00:38.300" style="s2">no Mark good</p>
<p begin="00:00:40.366" end="00:00:41.266" style="s2">darling</p>
<p begin="00:00:41.300" end="00:00:45.366" style="s2">I appreciate you keeping your promise by never marking anyone but me</p>
<p begin="00:00:46.166" end="00:00:47.566" style="s2">it&#39;s not about that</p>
<p begin="00:00:48.633" end="00:00:50.033" style="s2">sweetie you do understand that</p>
<p begin="00:00:50.033" end="00:00:53.366" style="s2">human marriages mean absolutely nothing in werewolf society right</p>
<p begin="00:00:53.700" end="00:00:56.366" style="s2">nothing is that why I&#39;m still unmarked</p>
<p begin="00:00:56.366" end="00:00:58.800" style="s2">because I&#39;m just human go home</p>
<p begin="00:00:59.233" end="00:01:00.900" style="s2">have the maid clean up your wound</p>
<p begin="00:01:01.166" end="00:01:02.733" style="s2">we really should go darling</p>
<p begin="00:01:06.233" end="00:01:07.466" style="s2">please Julian</p>
<p begin="00:01:07.466" end="00:01:10.000" style="s2">don&#39;t walk away you need to see this first</p>
<p begin="00:01:11.833" end="00:01:14.733" style="s2">I can&#39;t wait to tell Julia we&#39;re having a baby</p>
<p begin="00:01:15.433" end="00:01:16.900" style="s2">this changes everything</p>
<p begin="00:01:18.033" end="00:01:19.800" style="s2">whatever your little surprise is</p>
<p begin="00:01:19.800" end="00:01:22.900" style="s2">it can wait we can&#39;t be late for the baby&#39;s first checkup</p>
<p begin="00:01:22.900" end="00:01:24.333" style="s2">she&#39;s having your pup</p>
<p begin="00:01:25.633" end="00:01:28.600" style="s2">then this gift is not for you you don&#39;t deserve it</p>
<p begin="00:01:34.566" end="00:01:36.266" style="s2">baby Julian</p>
<p begin="00:01:36.266" end="00:01:38.100" style="s2">something&#39;s wrong why did you push her</p>
<p begin="00:01:38.100" end="00:01:39.700" style="s2">she&#39;s pregnant no I</p>
<p begin="00:01:39.700" end="00:01:41.400" style="s2">I I didn&#39;t I did</p>
<p begin="00:01:47.800" end="00:01:49.133" style="s2">give it back</p>
<p begin="00:01:50.833" end="00:01:53.466" style="s2">if you want it that badly fine</p>
<p begin="00:02:00.366" end="00:02:02.000" style="s2">stop the car Julian</p>
<p begin="00:02:02.366" end="00:02:04.566" style="s2">Amber just tripped she&#39;s fine</p>
<p begin="00:02:04.833" end="00:02:06.466" style="s2">but I&#39;m pregnant you know</p>
<p begin="00:02:06.466" end="00:02:07.933" style="s2">we can&#39;t be late for the hospital</p>
<p begin="00:02:15.200" end="00:02:16.100" style="s2">Julian</p>
<p begin="00:02:17.000" end="00:02:17.900" style="s2">Julian</p>
<p begin="00:02:19.100" end="00:02:21.466" style="s2">Julian please save our baby</p>
<p begin="00:02:23.266" end="00:02:24.366" style="s2">keep driving</p>
<p begin="00:02:25.866" end="00:02:29.100" style="s2">please I&#39;m sorry baby</p>
<p begin="00:02:29.200" end="00:02:31.466" style="s2">if your mommy weren&#39;t just some worthless human</p>
<p begin="00:02:31.466" end="00:02:35.500" style="s2">your daddy wouldn&#39;t have abandoned you to care for his other pup</p>
<p begin="00:02:39.100" end="00:02:41.400" style="s2">sister my princess</p>
<p begin="00:02:51.000" end="00:02:53.633" style="s2">my baby is my baby okay</p>
<p begin="00:02:53.633" end="00:02:55.900" style="s2">it&#39;s alright the baby is perfectly fine</p>
<p begin="00:02:56.100" end="00:02:57.266" style="s2">where am I</p>
<p begin="00:02:57.966" end="00:02:59.400" style="s2">who are you people</p>
<p begin="00:03:00.666" end="00:03:04.066" style="s2">my darling I&#39;m your father Magnus</p>
<p begin="00:03:05.033" end="00:03:06.333" style="s2">the Lycan king</p>
<p begin="00:03:07.633" end="00:03:09.400" style="s2">my father is the Lycan King</p>
<p begin="00:03:09.400" end="00:03:12.200" style="s2">and that makes you our one and only Lycan Princess</p>
<p begin="00:03:12.200" end="00:03:14.200" style="s2">I&#39;m Logan your big brother</p>
<p begin="00:03:14.466" end="00:03:16.733" style="s2">me the Lycan Princess</p>
<p begin="00:03:17.033" end="00:03:19.166" style="s2">this can&#39;t be real it is real</p>
<p begin="00:03:19.566" end="00:03:22.566" style="s2">you inherited our mother&#39;s legendary healing abilities</p>
<p begin="00:03:22.666" end="00:03:24.466" style="s2">that&#39;s why your baby is safe</p>
<p begin="00:03:30.966" end="00:03:32.733" style="s2">I fell and hit my head</p>
<p begin="00:03:33.500" end="00:03:37.000" style="s2">it was bl**ding now there&#39;s not even a scratch</p>
<p begin="00:03:37.466" end="00:03:39.466" style="s2">I really do have healing powers</p>
<p begin="00:03:40.666" end="00:03:43.333" style="s2">and I have a dad a brother</p>
<p begin="00:03:48.166" end="00:03:50.133" style="s2">but now I have to go back home</p>
<p begin="00:03:50.233" end="00:03:53.100" style="s2">back to that jerk he left you bl**ding in the rain</p>
<p begin="00:03:53.100" end="00:03:54.400" style="s2">he nearly k**led your baby</p>
<p begin="00:03:54.400" end="00:03:55.800" style="s2">I&#39;m not going back to him</p>
<p begin="00:03:57.066" end="00:03:58.866" style="s2">I&#39;m going back to divorce him</p>
<p begin="00:04:01.566" end="00:04:04.800" style="s2">last chance want me to come in and terrify him properly</p>
<p begin="00:04:06.066" end="00:04:08.200" style="s2">I can handle one arrogant alpha</p>
<p begin="00:04:11.033" end="00:04:14.933" style="s2">if you need backup or a body taken care of just mind link me</p>
<p begin="00:04:22.033" end="00:04:24.266" style="s2">Alpha Mrs Myers has returned</p>
<p begin="00:04:28.766" end="00:04:30.566" style="s2">where the hell were you last night</p>
<p begin="00:04:31.566" end="00:04:34.700" style="s2">do you know how many nights I waited up for you</p>
<p begin="00:04:35.700" end="00:04:37.466" style="s2">but it doesn&#39;t matter anymore</p>
<p begin="00:04:38.266" end="00:04:41.300" style="s2">I&#39;m here to end this end what</p>
<p begin="00:04:41.300" end="00:04:43.200" style="s2">what are you talking about us</p>
<p begin="00:04:43.633" end="00:04:46.500" style="s2">this mistake of a marriage I want a divorce</p>
<p begin="00:04:47.766" end="00:04:50.366" style="s2">I&#39;ve already signed the papers now it&#39;s your turn</p>
<p begin="00:04:56.566" end="00:04:58.733" style="s2">what game are you playing now you want more money</p>
<p begin="00:05:00.166" end="00:05:01.966" style="s2">if you&#39;d bothered reading the terms</p>
<p begin="00:05:01.966" end="00:05:03.600" style="s2">you&#39;d know I&#39;m not asking for anything</p>
<p begin="00:05:04.033" end="00:05:05.333" style="s2">if you have any questions</p>
<p begin="00:05:05.566" end="00:05:09.400" style="s2">you can ask my lawyer how the hell can you afford a lawyer</p>
<p begin="00:05:10.800" end="00:05:13.233" style="s2">unless you&#39;ve already found a new sugar daddy</p>
<p begin="00:05:13.233" end="00:05:14.733" style="s2">is that really how you see me</p>
<p begin="00:05:16.233" end="00:05:18.366" style="s2">just some gold digger in it for the money</p>
<p begin="00:05:20.966" end="00:05:22.533" style="s2">isn&#39;t that what you are</p>
<p begin="00:05:27.566" end="00:05:29.466" style="s2">you came to me with this remember</p>
<p begin="00:05:29.600" end="00:05:33.166" style="s2">$1 million per year to be my secret wife</p>
<p begin="00:05:33.166" end="00:05:35.033" style="s2">I needed that money to save Jeremy</p>
<p begin="00:05:35.033" end="00:05:36.700" style="s2">my friend from the orphanage</p>
<p begin="00:05:36.833" end="00:05:40.133" style="s2">being gay in werewolf society is worse than being human</p>
<p begin="00:05:40.466" end="00:05:42.066" style="s2">I was all he had</p>
<p begin="00:05:51.400" end="00:05:53.766" style="s2">Jeremy I got the money from Julian</p>
<p begin="00:05:53.900" end="00:05:55.466" style="s2">you have to hold on okay</p>
<p begin="00:05:55.466" end="00:05:57.000" style="s2">I&#39;ll always love you</p>
<p begin="00:05:58.000" end="00:06:00.966" style="s2">three years I loved you completely unconditionally</p>
<p begin="00:06:00.966" end="00:06:02.200" style="s2">not to mention we&#39;re mates</p>
<p begin="00:06:02.200" end="00:06:03.800" style="s2">but this is what you think of me</p>
<p begin="00:06:04.600" end="00:06:05.966" style="s2">let&#39;s end this quickly</p>
<p begin="00:06:07.866" end="00:06:10.333" style="s2">you think you can just walk away whenever it suits you</p>
<p begin="00:06:13.666" end="00:06:17.933" style="s2">clause 4.1 whenever I want you physically</p>
<p begin="00:06:18.366" end="00:06:20.466" style="s2">sexually emotionally</p>
<p begin="00:06:20.866" end="00:06:23.600" style="s2">you belong to me you&#39;re mine</p>
<p begin="00:06:29.400" end="00:06:32.500" style="s2">I sprinted here the second I saw the news</p>
<p begin="00:06:32.800" end="00:06:35.333" style="s2">you and Olivia finally</p>
<p begin="00:06:39.300" end="00:06:42.466" style="s2">it&#39;s time you got rid of this human leech once and for all</p>
<p begin="00:06:42.466" end="00:06:46.133" style="s2">I&#39;m already leaving everything you&#39;re wearing belongs to my son</p>
<p begin="00:06:48.200" end="00:06:50.033" style="s2">you gave me these on Christmas morning</p>
<p begin="00:06:50.033" end="00:06:51.900" style="s2">after three days of radio silence</p>
<p begin="00:06:58.000" end="00:06:59.266" style="s2">Valentine&#39;s Day</p>
<p begin="00:07:00.200" end="00:07:04.533" style="s2">your pathetic apology after disappearing for 2 months</p>
<p begin="00:07:07.200" end="00:07:10.466" style="s2">I slept clutching my phone terrified I&#39;d miss your call</p>
<p begin="00:07:12.266" end="00:07:15.900" style="s2">but nothing ever came and now I know why</p>
<p begin="00:07:16.066" end="00:07:17.666" style="s2">you weren&#39;t drowning in work</p>
<p begin="00:07:17.800" end="00:07:20.600" style="s2">you were drowning in her Amber that&#39;s not</p>
<p begin="00:07:22.100" end="00:07:23.700" style="s2">mom what the hell are you doing</p>
<p begin="00:07:25.833" end="00:07:27.700" style="s2">3 years bl**ding my son dry</p>
<p begin="00:07:27.700" end="00:07:30.133" style="s2">and you have the audacity to play victim</p>
<p begin="00:07:31.066" end="00:07:34.933" style="s2">Julian paid for every strap of fabric covering your worthless hide</p>
<p begin="00:07:35.200" end="00:07:38.333" style="s2">if you&#39;re slithering away give it all back now</p>
<p begin="00:07:42.800" end="00:07:44.766" style="s2">Amber stop this</p>
<p begin="00:07:44.866" end="00:07:46.066" style="s2">you don&#39;t have to</p>
<p begin="00:07:46.966" end="00:07:49.933" style="s2">isn&#39;t this exactly what your precious family dreamed of</p>
<p begin="00:07:50.400" end="00:07:54.100" style="s2">stripping me bare reminding me I never belonged in your world</p>
<p begin="00:08:00.800" end="00:08:02.966" style="s2">one last thing the ring</p>
<p begin="00:08:06.066" end="00:08:09.266" style="s2">keep it I&#39;d rather rip this bond out of me than belong to you</p>
<p begin="00:08:09.266" end="00:08:10.400" style="s2">for one more second</p>
<p begin="00:08:12.566" end="00:08:14.200" style="s2">that&#39;s not gonna work Amber</p>
<p begin="00:08:14.600" end="00:08:16.800" style="s2">only werewolves can reject humans</p>
<p begin="00:08:17.366" end="00:08:19.100" style="s2">you can&#39;t reject an alpha</p>
<p begin="00:08:19.100" end="00:08:20.800" style="s2">I Amber Myers</p>
<p begin="00:08:21.200" end="00:08:22.800" style="s2">reject you Julian Myers</p>
<p begin="00:08:22.800" end="00:08:25.900" style="s2">as my mate my alpha and my husband</p>
<p begin="00:08:26.433" end="00:08:28.866" style="s2">we are done</p>
<p begin="00:08:34.966" end="00:08:37.633" style="s2">typical human delusion all drama</p>
<p begin="00:08:37.633" end="00:08:39.966" style="s2">no substance see nothing</p>
<p begin="00:08:40.966" end="00:08:43.066" style="s2">Julian what&#39;s happening</p>
<p begin="00:08:45.433" end="00:08:48.000" style="s2">you&#39;re a werewolf impossible</p>
<p begin="00:08:48.766" end="00:08:51.566" style="s2">if you were a werewolf I&#39;d sense your wolf</p>
<p begin="00:08:51.900" end="00:08:56.400" style="s2">poor arrogant alpha hole werewolves can&#39;t sense a Lycan</p>
<p begin="00:09:01.166" end="00:09:03.666" style="s2">I refuse to accept your rejection</p>
<p begin="00:09:04.300" end="00:09:08.566" style="s2">no matter if it works you can talk to my lawyer from now on</p>
<p begin="00:09:08.666" end="00:09:09.900" style="s2">I&#39;m done with you</p>
<p begin="00:09:16.033" end="00:09:17.133" style="s2">Amber wait</p>
<p begin="00:09:23.033" end="00:09:23.933" style="s2">take this</p>
<p begin="00:09:24.966" end="00:09:26.666" style="s2">I won&#39;t let you walk away with nothing</p>
<p begin="00:09:45.033" end="00:09:47.533" style="s2">who the hell are you get your filthy hands off my wife</p>
<p begin="00:09:47.700" end="00:09:49.666" style="s2">who the hell are you Amber</p>
<p begin="00:09:49.666" end="00:09:51.366" style="s2">what do you want more money</p>
<p begin="00:09:51.366" end="00:09:52.900" style="s2">fine 1 million</p>
<p begin="00:09:52.900" end="00:09:54.733" style="s2">two million name your price</p>
<p begin="00:09:55.600" end="00:09:56.900" style="s2">here&#39;s 10 million</p>
<p begin="00:09:57.266" end="00:10:00.133" style="s2">stay away from her or I&#39;ll make you regret coming here</p>
<p begin="00:10:13.833" end="00:10:15.366" style="s2">hi this is Amber</p>
<p begin="00:10:15.400" end="00:10:17.366" style="s2">sorry I&#39;m not available right now</p>
<p begin="00:10:21.266" end="00:10:22.800" style="s2">hi this is Amber</p>
<p begin="00:10:22.833" end="00:10:24.300" style="s2">sorry I&#39;m not available</p>
<p begin="00:10:35.900" end="00:10:38.100" style="s2">this wall tastes like liquid garbage</p>
<p begin="00:10:38.200" end="00:10:40.100" style="s2">and where&#39;s my toast Mrs</p>
<p begin="00:10:40.100" end="00:10:43.066" style="s2">Myers always prepared your breakfast sir</p>
<p begin="00:10:43.100" end="00:10:46.166" style="s2">she ground the beans baked bread from scratch</p>
<p begin="00:10:46.233" end="00:10:49.933" style="s2">made everything perfect get out now</p>
<p begin="00:10:56.466" end="00:10:58.366" style="s2">it&#39;s like she was never here</p>
<p begin="00:10:58.366" end="00:11:00.466" style="s2">like she never existed at all</p>
<p begin="00:11:07.900" end="00:11:10.166" style="s2">sir we still can&#39;t locate Mrs</p>
<p begin="00:11:10.166" end="00:11:11.000" style="s2">Myers her records</p>
<p begin="00:11:11.000" end="00:11:13.766" style="s2">her phone her digital trail have all been professionally erased</p>
<p begin="00:11:15.000" end="00:11:19.233" style="s2">keep searching tear apart the entire goddamn world if necessary</p>
<p begin="00:11:19.233" end="00:11:21.666" style="s2">we did find this her medical files</p>
<p begin="00:11:21.666" end="00:11:22.933" style="s2">I think you wanna see it</p>
<p begin="00:11:23.866" end="00:11:25.100" style="s2">Amber&#39;s pregnant</p>
<p begin="00:11:25.666" end="00:11:28.733" style="s2">find her I can&#39;t let her face this alone</p>
<p begin="00:11:28.866" end="00:11:29.966" style="s2">do you know what day it is</p>
<p begin="00:11:29.966" end="00:11:30.866" style="s2">next month</p>
<p begin="00:11:31.600" end="00:11:33.200" style="s2">your birthday little sister</p>
<p begin="00:11:33.666" end="00:11:36.933" style="s2">my birthday I stopped celebrating years ago</p>
<p begin="00:11:37.033" end="00:11:38.566" style="s2">orphans don&#39;t get parties</p>
<p begin="00:11:40.166" end="00:11:43.100" style="s2">then we&#39;ll throw you the Celebration of a lifetime</p>
<p begin="00:11:43.700" end="00:11:46.200" style="s2">time for the world to meet its liken princess</p>
<p begin="00:11:54.000" end="00:11:55.133" style="s2">suit up bro</p>
<p begin="00:11:55.400" end="00:11:57.566" style="s2">Tonight&#39;s the Lion Princess birthday party</p>
<p begin="00:11:57.966" end="00:12:00.566" style="s2">word is she&#39;s been found after missing for 20 years</p>
<p begin="00:12:00.966" end="00:12:03.500" style="s2">I&#39;m hunting for my wife not a princess</p>
<p begin="00:12:03.700" end="00:12:06.466" style="s2">come on I knew the princess when we were kids</p>
<p begin="00:12:06.466" end="00:12:09.100" style="s2">spent years praying to the Moon Goddess I&#39;d marry her someday</p>
<p begin="00:12:09.100" end="00:12:11.300" style="s2">now she&#39;s back single gorgeous</p>
<p begin="00:12:11.300" end="00:12:12.700" style="s2">what wolf could ask for more</p>
<p begin="00:12:12.700" end="00:12:14.500" style="s2">my wife&#39;s been missing for a month</p>
<p begin="00:12:14.500" end="00:12:17.133" style="s2">and you&#39;re here fantasizing about your childhood crush</p>
<p begin="00:12:18.200" end="00:12:19.366" style="s2">I&#39;m not going anywhere</p>
