<p begin="00:48:07.000" end="00:48:11.033" style="s2">you clumsy human why are you so catastrophically careless</p>
<p begin="00:48:11.033" end="00:48:13.566" style="s2">that was our only hope seriously</p>
<p begin="00:48:13.966" end="00:48:17.066" style="s2">did you really think I wouldn&#39;t notice your pathetic scheming</p>
<p begin="00:48:17.066" end="00:48:19.333" style="s2">you can&#39;t accuse me without evidence</p>
<p begin="00:48:22.266" end="00:48:24.800" style="s2">this is the actual antidote</p>
<p begin="00:48:25.500" end="00:48:29.066" style="s2">security footage of your attempted sabotage should arrive momentarily</p>
<p begin="00:48:34.300" end="00:48:36.166" style="s2">you have the right to remain silent anything</p>
<p begin="00:48:36.166" end="00:48:38.800" style="s2">you say can and will be used against you in a court of law</p>
<p begin="00:48:40.000" end="00:48:43.400" style="s2">Olivia you swore Amber didn&#39;t get the antidote</p>
<p begin="00:48:43.400" end="00:48:45.066" style="s2">why did you lie to me</p>
<p begin="00:48:46.000" end="00:48:49.166" style="s2">don&#39;t slander me I don&#39;t even know who you are</p>
<p begin="00:48:49.166" end="00:48:51.233" style="s2">you manipulative alpha b**ch</p>
<p begin="00:48:51.233" end="00:48:53.000" style="s2">how could you do this to me</p>
<p begin="00:48:53.000" end="00:48:54.900" style="s2">now explain everything</p>
<p begin="00:48:55.466" end="00:48:57.266" style="s2">ah it hurts</p>
<p begin="00:48:57.266" end="00:48:59.166" style="s2">I think I need to go to the hospital</p>
<p begin="00:48:59.466" end="00:49:00.266" style="s2">ah</p>
<p begin="00:49:01.000" end="00:49:02.666" style="s2">you are at the hospital</p>
<p begin="00:49:03.366" end="00:49:06.066" style="s2">no no absolutely not</p>
<p begin="00:49:10.100" end="00:49:12.666" style="s2">please don&#39;t let that monster near my precious baby</p>
<p begin="00:49:12.666" end="00:49:15.000" style="s2">she ass**ted me and tried to hurt my child</p>
<p begin="00:49:16.033" end="00:49:20.100" style="s2">that human demon attempted to m**der your baby</p>
<p begin="00:49:21.500" end="00:49:24.666" style="s2">don&#39;t you ever raise your hand against my mate</p>
<p begin="00:49:28.500" end="00:49:30.266" style="s2">shall we proceed with the examination</p>
<p begin="00:49:37.800" end="00:49:40.333" style="s2">is something wrong with the baby no</p>
<p begin="00:49:41.633" end="00:49:45.733" style="s2">because there is no baby what do you mean she isn&#39;t pregnant</p>
<p begin="00:49:48.166" end="00:49:50.033" style="s2">this incompetent human knows nothing</p>
<p begin="00:49:50.033" end="00:49:51.666" style="s2">she&#39;s incapable of sensing an alpha pup</p>
<p begin="00:49:51.666" end="00:49:53.100" style="s2">she&#39;s lying through her teeth</p>
<p begin="00:49:53.166" end="00:49:54.466" style="s2">how is that possible</p>
<p begin="00:49:55.466" end="00:49:57.100" style="s2">I&#39;ve seen the medical records</p>
<p begin="00:50:01.700" end="00:50:04.666" style="s2">I assume Tiffany helped you fabricate the pregnancy reports</p>
<p begin="00:50:04.700" end="00:50:06.833" style="s2">you promised her my position in exchange</p>
<p begin="00:50:06.833" end="00:50:08.666" style="s2">Julian this isn&#39;t what you think</p>
<p begin="00:50:08.766" end="00:50:10.400" style="s2">please let me explain everything</p>
<p begin="00:50:11.100" end="00:50:13.700" style="s2">Marcus saved my life during the shifter&#39;s war</p>
<p begin="00:50:14.266" end="00:50:16.366" style="s2">his d**ng wish was for me to protect you</p>
<p begin="00:50:16.366" end="00:50:18.433" style="s2">his mate and his unborn child</p>
<p begin="00:50:18.433" end="00:50:20.933" style="s2">and you&#39;ve been lying to me the entire f**king time</p>
<p begin="00:50:21.100" end="00:50:22.100" style="s2">what</p>
<p begin="00:50:22.833" end="00:50:24.700" style="s2">I thought she was carrying your heir</p>
<p begin="00:50:25.233" end="00:50:28.833" style="s2">so Julian believed Olivia was carrying his friend&#39;s baby</p>
<p begin="00:50:28.833" end="00:50:31.100" style="s2">not his Olivia</p>
<p begin="00:50:31.800" end="00:50:34.466" style="s2">you&#39;re permanently banned from Thorn pack territory</p>
<p begin="00:50:42.366" end="00:50:43.033" style="s2">Amber can you</p>
<p begin="00:50:43.033" end="00:50:45.300" style="s2">come back to me I never cheated</p>
<p begin="00:50:45.300" end="00:50:47.100" style="s2">there&#39;s nothing between Olivia and me</p>
<p begin="00:50:47.100" end="00:50:48.900" style="s2">you think our problem is just Olivia</p>
<p begin="00:50:49.033" end="00:50:52.133" style="s2">you don&#39;t understand you never trusted me</p>
<p begin="00:50:52.233" end="00:50:53.500" style="s2">you never really wanted me</p>
<p begin="00:50:53.500" end="00:50:56.300" style="s2">I do want you prove it</p>
<p begin="00:50:58.766" end="00:51:00.066" style="s2">this is a mistake</p>
<p begin="00:51:01.066" end="00:51:02.400" style="s2">cut the bond Julian</p>
<p begin="00:51:02.766" end="00:51:06.066" style="s2">reject me end all of this t**ture</p>
<p begin="00:51:15.366" end="00:51:17.466" style="s2">alpha the breakfast you&#39;ve been sending Mrs</p>
<p begin="00:51:17.466" end="00:51:20.200" style="s2">Myers every morning they&#39;ve been rejected again</p>
<p begin="00:51:22.666" end="00:51:27.666" style="s2">I heard you injured yourself making toast burned it 15 * 50 times</p>
<p begin="00:51:33.366" end="00:51:34.666" style="s2">she really doesn&#39;t want to forgive me</p>
<p begin="00:51:34.666" end="00:51:37.933" style="s2">does she maybe I should just give up and let her go</p>
<p begin="00:51:41.033" end="00:51:43.366" style="s2">I&#39;m planning a surprise proposal for the princess</p>
<p begin="00:51:43.366" end="00:51:46.466" style="s2">you have to come everyone from the like inside will be there</p>
<p begin="00:51:46.466" end="00:51:48.866" style="s2">will the prince bring his girlfriend</p>
<p begin="00:51:48.866" end="00:51:50.600" style="s2">I didn&#39;t know Logan had a girlfriend</p>
<p begin="00:51:50.600" end="00:51:52.500" style="s2">but if he does of course he&#39;ll bring her</p>
<p begin="00:51:54.666" end="00:51:55.866" style="s2">I&#39;ll be there</p>
<p begin="00:51:57.633" end="00:51:58.433" style="s2">hahaha</p>
<p begin="00:52:04.400" end="00:52:05.100" style="s2">today</p>
<p begin="00:52:05.100" end="00:52:08.700" style="s2">I&#39;m honored to have you all here to witness this life changing moment</p>
<p begin="00:52:12.800" end="00:52:14.566" style="s2">will you marry me my princess</p>
<p begin="00:52:16.300" end="00:52:18.133" style="s2">make me the happiest wolf alive</p>
<p begin="00:52:26.266" end="00:52:27.666" style="s2">bro what the hell are you doing</p>
<p begin="00:52:27.666" end="00:52:29.100" style="s2">you&#39;re the Lycan princess</p>
<p begin="00:52:29.633" end="00:52:31.166" style="s2">so Logan&#39;s not your lover</p>
<p begin="00:52:31.366" end="00:52:34.300" style="s2">he&#39;s your brother so choose me</p>
<p begin="00:52:34.300" end="00:52:37.866" style="s2">the Lycan Kingdom will never entrust the princess to trash like you</p>
<p begin="00:52:37.866" end="00:52:42.400" style="s2">so the b**tard who made my angel cry for years was you</p>
<p begin="00:52:43.400" end="00:52:46.000" style="s2">I&#39;ve always considered you one of my best friends but now</p>
<p begin="00:52:51.866" end="00:52:53.400" style="s2">I&#39;m trying to make things right</p>
<p begin="00:52:53.766" end="00:52:56.966" style="s2">I came here for Amber stop both of you</p>
<p begin="00:53:07.700" end="00:53:09.366" style="s2">you piece of sh**</p>
<p begin="00:53:11.366" end="00:53:12.666" style="s2">from today forward</p>
<p begin="00:53:12.766" end="00:53:15.433" style="s2">I announce my candidates for werewolf president</p>
<p begin="00:53:15.433" end="00:53:17.666" style="s2">and I vow to defeat Julian Myers</p>
<p begin="00:53:18.400" end="00:53:20.466" style="s2">Today&#39;s historic showdown</p>
<p begin="00:53:20.566" end="00:53:23.266" style="s2">Alpha Julian versus Alpha Roman</p>
<p begin="00:53:23.966" end="00:53:25.500" style="s2">currently deadlocked</p>
<p begin="00:53:26.166" end="00:53:28.100" style="s2">who will claim the presidency</p>
<p begin="00:53:28.666" end="00:53:30.900" style="s2">you still have feelings for Julian Myers</p>
<p begin="00:53:33.700" end="00:53:37.066" style="s2">absolutely not I just wanna watch him crash and burn</p>
<p begin="00:53:37.866" end="00:53:38.700" style="s2">hahaha</p>
<p begin="00:53:39.266" end="00:53:41.900" style="s2">sure and I&#39;m a vegetarian vampire</p>
<p begin="00:53:43.400" end="00:53:45.900" style="s2">look I only want my little sister to find happiness</p>
<p begin="00:53:51.833" end="00:53:55.133" style="s2">watching you suffer like this is killing me slowly</p>
<p begin="00:53:58.166" end="00:53:59.900" style="s2">it&#39;s time to tell him everything</p>
<p begin="00:54:00.166" end="00:54:03.533" style="s2">the whole truth it&#39;s time to tell him everything</p>
<p begin="00:54:12.800" end="00:54:14.400" style="s2">d** b**ch</p>
<p begin="00:54:29.700" end="00:54:30.966" style="s2">please Moon Goddess</p>
<p begin="00:54:31.066" end="00:54:33.033" style="s2">not my baby Alpha Julian</p>
<p begin="00:54:33.033" end="00:54:36.400" style="s2">Alpha Roman claims that you publicly cheated on your wife with Olivia</p>
<p begin="00:54:36.400" end="00:54:38.066" style="s2">that&#39;s categorically false</p>
<p begin="00:54:39.566" end="00:54:41.100" style="s2">our mate is in danger</p>
<p begin="00:54:53.433" end="00:54:54.633" style="s2">alpha if you leave now</p>
<p begin="00:54:54.633" end="00:54:58.533" style="s2">you&#39;re voluntarily withdrawing from the election I don&#39;t f**king care</p>
<p begin="00:55:06.600" end="00:55:08.733" style="s2">my healing power is slipping away</p>
<p begin="00:55:08.900" end="00:55:12.133" style="s2">maybe this time I really will lose my baby</p>
<p begin="00:55:13.233" end="00:55:16.566" style="s2">you&#39;ve been pregnant all along with my baby</p>
<p begin="00:55:17.966" end="00:55:18.800" style="s2">no</p>
<p begin="00:55:20.400" end="00:55:21.933" style="s2">no don&#39;t leave me now</p>
<p begin="00:55:31.666" end="00:55:34.466" style="s2">Alpha Julian we apprehended the hit and run driver</p>
<p begin="00:55:34.466" end="00:55:38.600" style="s2">Julian you sacrificed everything for that human waste</p>
<p begin="00:55:41.000" end="00:55:43.333" style="s2">first human</p>
<p begin="00:55:44.100" end="00:55:46.333" style="s2">Amber is the Lycan princess</p>
<p begin="00:55:48.800" end="00:55:55.166" style="s2">second you better pray she survives or I&#39;ll make you answer for it</p>
<p begin="00:55:59.500" end="00:56:01.900" style="s2">you&#39;ll pay for what you did in prison</p>
<p begin="00:56:02.000" end="00:56:04.266" style="s2">for the rest of your miserable life</p>
<p begin="00:56:10.066" end="00:56:14.300" style="s2">it&#39;s miraculous your mate bond reactivated her healing powers</p>
<p begin="00:56:14.300" end="00:56:16.466" style="s2">she and the baby are gonna be perfectly fine</p>
<p begin="00:56:20.000" end="00:56:21.300" style="s2">take the Moon Goddess</p>
<p begin="00:56:26.966" end="00:56:29.466" style="s2">you gave up your campaign for me</p>
<p begin="00:56:29.466" end="00:56:33.133" style="s2">shh just rest you need to heal</p>
<p begin="00:56:36.100" end="00:56:39.866" style="s2">I&#39;m sorry for everything I&#39;ve put you through</p>
<p begin="00:56:39.866" end="00:56:41.700" style="s2">I know you might not forgive me now</p>
<p begin="00:56:41.700" end="00:56:43.466" style="s2">but I will wait patiently</p>
<p begin="00:56:47.766" end="00:56:49.866" style="s2">man if you make her shed a single tear again</p>
<p begin="00:56:49.866" end="00:56:52.133" style="s2">I&#39;ll burn you and your entire bank</p>
<p begin="00:56:53.066" end="00:56:54.366" style="s2">don&#39;t worry I won&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:57:04.200" end="00:57:06.600" style="s2">Amber will you marry me again</p>
<p begin="00:57:07.833" end="00:57:08.666" style="s2">wait</p>
<p begin="00:57:09.600" end="00:57:10.666" style="s2">Jeremy</p>
<p begin="00:57:12.000" end="00:57:13.300" style="s2">finally I made it</p>
<p begin="00:57:15.000" end="00:57:16.800" style="s2">thank you for paying for my treatment</p>
<p begin="00:57:16.800" end="00:57:18.633" style="s2">Amber&#39;s my only friend from the orphanage</p>
<p begin="00:57:18.633" end="00:57:19.233" style="s2">and wow</p>
<p begin="00:57:19.233" end="00:57:21.900" style="s2">she wasn&#39;t lying you really are a super hot</p>
<p begin="00:57:21.900" end="00:57:23.933" style="s2">this is why you signed that contract with me</p>
<p begin="00:57:24.000" end="00:57:27.400" style="s2">to save your friend what else did you think handsome I&#39;m gay</p>
<p begin="00:57:29.233" end="00:57:30.233" style="s2">I&#39;m sorry Amber</p>
<p begin="00:57:30.233" end="00:57:31.866" style="s2">truly deeply sorry</p>
<p begin="00:57:36.200" end="00:57:37.400" style="s2">Amber Lockwood</p>
<p begin="00:57:37.966" end="00:57:40.100" style="s2">mate healer Princess</p>
<p begin="00:57:40.100" end="00:57:41.666" style="s2">the strongest woman I know</p>
<p begin="00:57:41.666" end="00:57:43.666" style="s2">will you be my first and only Luna</p>
<p begin="00:57:43.800" end="00:57:46.766" style="s2">yes my answer is yes</p>
